association between smoking during pregnancy and breast cancer using Massachusetts registry data (United States)</article-title><source>Cancer Causes Control</source><year>2003</year><volume>14</volume><fpage>497</fpage><lpage>503</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Cancer Causes Control||14|497||bib11|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">12946045</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hsieh</surname><given-names>CC</given-names></name><name><surname>Trichopoulos</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Katsouyanni</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Yuasa</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Age at menarche, age at menopause, height and obesity as risk factors for breast cancer: associations and interactions in an international case&#x02013;control study</article-title><source>Int J Cancer</source><year>1990</year><volume>46</volume><fpage>796</fpage><lpage>800</lpage><!--PubMed citation query: 'Int J Cancer||46|796||bib12|'--><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">2228308</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="bib13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Hunter</surname><given-names>DJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Hankinson</surname><given-names>SE</given-names></name><name><surname>Hough</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Gertig</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Garcia-Closas</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Spiegelman</surname><given-names>D</given-names></name><name><surname>Manson</surname><given-names>JE</given-names></name><name><surname>Colditz</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Willett</surname><given-names>WC</given-names></name><name><surname>Speizer</surname><given-names>FE</given-names></name><name><surname>Kelsey</surname><given-names>K</given-names></